From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneplus6t-pmos-fixes <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: wcd934x: capture path needs MCLK

Mainline wcd934x has no dependency from the AIF capture widgets on the
codec MCLK widget. Capture only worked while MCLK happened to be left on by
an earlier playback; once nothing else kept it on, recording returned
digital silence. Make AIF1/2/3 CAP depend on MCLK.
---
diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
index 0f29a187e..f7899554d 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
@@ -5795,6 +5795,13 @@ static const struct snd_soc_dapm_route wcd934x_audio_map[] = {
 	{"AIF1 CAP", NULL, "AIF1_CAP Mixer"},
 	{"AIF2 CAP", NULL, "AIF2_CAP Mixer"},
 	{"AIF3 CAP", NULL, "AIF3_CAP Mixer"},
+	/*
+	 * The TX chain (ADC, decimators, SLIM TX) runs on MCLK too. Without
+	 * these routes capture only worked while MCLK happened to be left on.
+	 */
+	{"AIF1 CAP", NULL, "MCLK"},
+	{"AIF2 CAP", NULL, "MCLK"},
+	{"AIF3 CAP", NULL, "MCLK"},
 
 	WCD934X_SLIM_TX_AIF_PATH(0),
 	WCD934X_SLIM_TX_AIF_PATH(1),
